  {
   "id": "dusk-diver-2-171860@1.06",
   "gameId": "dusk-diver-2-171860",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.06",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-08-31T03:49:31.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "1. Accelerates the Party Satiety depletion rate.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. Adjusts the threshold condition for the use of Burst Ultimate to 160% Burst Level.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. Specific characters have a chance to trigger Wall Launch or Lacerate from Break Strikes (Ground).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. Slightly increases Bonus EXP gained from knocking down enemies with Burst Ultimate.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "5. Increases both damages dealt and received by companions.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "6. Support skill level limits have changed to Lv2 in New Game mode.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "7. Some Bosses will now regenerate Super Armor while not undertaking damage but have their HP and Super Armor value reduced.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "8. Lowers the Weapon Rank requirements for skill learning.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "9. Other balance changes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
